{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/extras/56880c32c69c295da6416af7c5c20be2.poster.avif?t=1768557966\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/extras/56880c32c69c295da6416af7c5c20be2.webm?t=1768557966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where combat never has to go the same way twice. Engage the lupine enemy in dynamic combat, with responsive and precise battle controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a host of ferocious enemies, ranging from the smallest minions to hulking monstrosities \u2013 with an army augmented by the despicable Doctor Wolf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new weapons, skills and abilities to pick up on each run, but Protectors beware! One wrong move and while Omega will persist through death, any modifications collected will be lost as you hit a new Loop with a fresh loadout \u2013 it\u2019s time to steel your woollen form, and protect the flock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/extras/20e85289bcbc85d6925e105e0d75bfd9.poster.avif?t=1768557966\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/extras/20e85289bcbc85d6925e105e0d75bfd9.webm?t=1768557966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeating enemies, players will download and evolve critical skills to help you fight through the Loop. Rather than just acquiring new skills, Ovis Loop gives you the choice between passive and active upgrades for each skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide to buff the skill you have, or add an additional chained skill to carry on carving your way through Doctor Wolf\u2019s minions. Our skill and combo system allows you to play your way. Focus on strengthening just one skill, or embrace the dynamic force of the chain, it\u2019s up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/extras/089da5697c9e86e851c7feeafeceb8d2.poster.avif?t=1768557966\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/extras/089da5697c9e86e851c7feeafeceb8d2.webm?t=1768557966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Alpha enemy and Doctor Wolf\u2019s augmented monstrosities provide increasingly difficult challenges as you progress through the Loop. As well as harbouring secrets about Ovis Loop\u2019s world and inhabitants, they also learn from your own playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you like to charge in, use area of effect or dive in and out, each boss will adapt to meet your challenge. Focus on dodging and find a boss that aggressively pursues. If you prefer to rush in, it\u2019ll retreat to find space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You define the battle, but each Loop is designed to test you with more than simple pattern recognition. Overcome each challenge through intuitive action and a build that works for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/extras/b82b01b153b61ac09c9af8afaf4e0bbd.poster.avif?t=1768557966\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/extras/b82b01b153b61ac09c9af8afaf4e0bbd.webm?t=1768557966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unconventional story, maybe, but this is not the tale you have heard before. As well as powerful new skills and abilities, you\u2019ll uncover secrets about Ovis Loop\u2019s post-apocalyptic world and (more importantly) about our hero Omega. Become the Shepherd, protect your flock, and delve into the mysteries you find in each Loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ovis Loop is the chronicle of just one lone sheep, trapped in a brutal, looping war with a lupine enemy. In this fight, you must stand alone, but Ovis Loop gives you the tools to succeed, for those with wool made of steel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/extras/396af96147c01f453913f17b082a9728.avif?t=1768557966\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Successful Test Subject","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2226730/810ff04737d2785874acbc5768c176ce06f4bf93.jpg"},{"name":"Next-Generation Wreckage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2226730/dec14cc871acd6c6946c0a92ce0339067930f94e.jpg"},{"name":"Dr. Wolf","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2226730/2523b027b0a2f48ba582ba8ed83da6b385526072.jpg"},{"name":"Seized the Wolves' Transport","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2226730/751651455279358348f986c68e5eedadba0e1d79.jpg"},{"name":"Limit Break","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2226730/1396607362c7f53c75c31607c575b82298f2ba88.jpg"},{"name":"Start of the Loop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2226730/2822daf70d2ecfe0c231b39aaaf473dd73d51ce1.jpg"},{"name":"Module Enthusiast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2226730/1f5b7a665cf23693b0e9bdb47d479de2b1accd2a.jpg"},{"name":"Blacksmith","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2226730/8367cd7719ae3b2c441c9e99e2ec420e260500a1.jpg"},{"name":"Doom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2226730/6ed73af5736b17d3a251584620a0e9203a4f895b.jpg"},{"name":"Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2226730/c6117a9b4a7d60e8a20c5092675144fa8eec6687.jpg"}],"total":32},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2226730?t=1768557966","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/2ac3871c14b90549d6c896e48de32d141608f2e1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768557966","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/4c916a320f01d22b561239c7e53b5f27b0e8579c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768557966","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/4c916a320f01d22b561239c7e53b5f27b0e8579c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768557966","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2277700,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Join Our Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve been so lucky to find an incredible number of Protectors stepping up to defend the flock, and give us such wonderful feedback throughout demos and playtesting. We hope to continue working closely with you throughout the Early Access period and you can find us on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X / Twitter | Discord | Steam Community | YouTube</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/extras/dd1879f50823e15900d537ec9aea4087.poster.avif?t=1768557966\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/extras/dd1879f50823e15900d537ec9aea4087.webm?t=1768557966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/extras/dd1879f50823e15900d537ec9aea4087.mp4?t=1768557966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ROADMAP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/extras/05385221388b6e466ab0a72ae4a391ed.avif?t=1768557966\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/extras_big/05385221388b6e466ab0a72ae4a391ed.avif?t=1768557966 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>A Note from the Developers</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/extras/9ad6c901d785ebe401dfe12eabce25a2.avif?t=1768557966\" width=600 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi everyone! We are LIFUEL, the development team behind Ovis Loop. We are a small team of just three developers, working closely with our wonderful community to build our first game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy fast-paced dynamic combat and satisfying, side-scrolling roguelike action, we hope that you\u2019ll join us in Early Access, to hit the Loop and protect the flock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While Ovis Loop is our first development journey, we are committed to using our in-depth understanding of action art and our knowledge as players, to develop a high-quality game that you can love as much as we do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re looking to provide continuous two-way communication throughout the Early Access period \u2013 while adding new content and optimising all areas of the game. But in addition to this, the community (and your feedback) is so important to us, and we really hope that you will come on this journey as well, to help guide Ovis Loop to its 1.0 launch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope that Ovis Loop delivers a fun, engaging and worthwhile experience, and we hope that you will help us to create this together.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/extras/56880c32c69c295da6416af7c5c20be2.poster.avif?t=1768557966\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/extras/56880c32c69c295da6416af7c5c20be2.webm?t=1768557966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where combat never has to go the same way twice. Engage the lupine enemy in dynamic combat, with responsive and precise battle controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a host of ferocious enemies, ranging from the smallest minions to hulking monstrosities \u2013 with an army augmented by the despicable Doctor Wolf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new weapons, skills and abilities to pick up on each run, but Protectors beware! One wrong move and while Omega will persist through death, any modifications collected will be lost as you hit a new Loop with a fresh loadout \u2013 it\u2019s time to steel your woollen form, and protect the flock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/extras/20e85289bcbc85d6925e105e0d75bfd9.poster.avif?t=1768557966\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/extras/20e85289bcbc85d6925e105e0d75bfd9.webm?t=1768557966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeating enemies, players will download and evolve critical skills to help you fight through the Loop. Rather than just acquiring new skills, Ovis Loop gives you the choice between passive and active upgrades for each skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide to buff the skill you have, or add an additional chained skill to carry on carving your way through Doctor Wolf\u2019s minions. Our skill and combo system allows you to play your way. Focus on strengthening just one skill, or embrace the dynamic force of the chain, it\u2019s up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/extras/089da5697c9e86e851c7feeafeceb8d2.poster.avif?t=1768557966\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/extras/089da5697c9e86e851c7feeafeceb8d2.webm?t=1768557966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Alpha enemy and Doctor Wolf\u2019s augmented monstrosities provide increasingly difficult challenges as you progress through the Loop. As well as harbouring secrets about Ovis Loop\u2019s world and inhabitants, they also learn from your own playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you like to charge in, use area of effect or dive in and out, each boss will adapt to meet your challenge. Focus on dodging and find a boss that aggressively pursues. If you prefer to rush in, it\u2019ll retreat to find space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You define the battle, but each Loop is designed to test you with more than simple pattern recognition. Overcome each challenge through intuitive action and a build that works for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/extras/b82b01b153b61ac09c9af8afaf4e0bbd.poster.avif?t=1768557966\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/extras/b82b01b153b61ac09c9af8afaf4e0bbd.webm?t=1768557966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unconventional story, maybe, but this is not the tale you have heard before. As well as powerful new skills and abilities, you\u2019ll uncover secrets about Ovis Loop\u2019s post-apocalyptic world and (more importantly) about our hero Omega. Become the Shepherd, protect your flock, and delve into the mysteries you find in each Loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ovis Loop is the chronicle of just one lone sheep, trapped in a brutal, looping war with a lupine enemy. In this fight, you must stand alone, but Ovis Loop gives you the tools to succeed, for those with wool made of steel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/extras/396af96147c01f453913f17b082a9728.avif?t=1768557966\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p>","developers":["LIFUEL"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226730/0eba149920684c03572704ae23059a4de935888b/header.jpg?t=1768557966","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2226730/1805124235/9a1da8355b62cb8968e9921bd3dc2f03dba349fc/1755168162/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755187230","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2226730/1805124235/9a1da8355b62cb8968e9921bd3dc2f03dba349fc/1755168162/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755187230","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2226730/1805124235/9a1da8355b62cb8968e9921bd3dc2f03dba349fc/1755168162/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755187230","id":257183087,"name":"Early Access Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257183087/500515b241655e98e06957443904ac7946634974/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755187230"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2226730/1254356515/284adf0e0aa42feff58ef9c3a5de1d2a1a144a14/1750321917/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750325386","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2226730/1254356515/284adf0e0aa42feff58ef9c3a5de1d2a1a144a14/1750321917/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750325386","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2226730/1254356515/284adf0e0aa42feff58ef9c3a5de1d2a1a144a14/1750321917/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750325386","id":257158662,"name":"Early Access Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a